# Analysis artifacts (nbody/analysis/<block>/...) — трекается только каталог
# графиков REGISTRY.md, сгенерированный runners/registry_docs.py,
# плюс карта блоков README.md и перенесённые текстовые артефакты
# (summary*.txt, *.param, мигрированный sidm20 README). Сгенерированные
# PNG/GIF остаются ignored глобальными правилами выше.
# Отдельные README-карты previous_runs/кампаний не ведутся (решение 2026-10-09:
# излишне; след миграции — git-история переименований).
nbody/analysis/**
!nbody/analysis/REGISTRY.md
!nbody/analysis/README.md
!nbody/analysis/previous_runs/
!nbody/analysis/previous_runs/cdm_sidm_comparison/
!nbody/analysis/previous_runs/cdm_sidm_comparison/*.txt
!nbody/analysis/previous_runs/sidm20_N1e6_T5/
!nbody/analysis/previous_runs/sidm20_N1e6_T5/*.md
!nbody/analysis/previous_runs/sidm20_N1e6_T5/*.txt
!nbody/analysis/previous_runs/sidm20_N1e6_T5/*.param
!nbody/analysis/previous_runs/sidm20_N1e6_T5/analysis/
!nbody/analysis/previous_runs/sidm20_N1e6_T5/analysis/*.txt
!nbody/analysis/previous_runs/sidm_sigma0.1/
!nbody/analysis/campaigns/
!nbody/analysis/campaigns/cdm_sidm_N1e6/
!nbody/analysis/campaigns/cdm_sidm_N1e6/compare/
!nbody/analysis/campaigns/cdm_sidm_N1e6/compare/N100k/
!nbody/analysis/campaigns/cdm_sidm_N1e6/compare/N100k/*.txt
!nbody/analysis/campaigns/cdm_sidm_N1e6/compare/N1e6/
!nbody/analysis/campaigns/cdm_sidm_N1e6/compare/N1e6/*.txt
!nbody/analysis/ic/
!nbody/analysis/ic/corecusp_N1e7/
!nbody/analysis/ic/corecusp_N1e7/*.json
!nbody/analysis/ic/corecusp_N1e7/*.txt
!nbody/analysis/ic/corecusp_N1e7/*.csv
!nbody/analysis/prerun/
!nbody/analysis/prerun/corecusp_cdm_N1e7_T5/
!nbody/analysis/prerun/corecusp_cdm_N1e7_T5/early_gate/
!nbody/analysis/prerun/corecusp_cdm_N1e7_T5/early_gate/*.txt
!nbody/analysis/prerun/corecusp_cdm_N1e7_T5/early_gate/*.json
!nbody/analysis/prerun/corecusp_cdm_N1e7_T5/early_gate/*.csv
!nbody/analysis/prerun/corecusp_cdm_N1e7_T5/early_gate/*.md
# Curated presentation inputs are source assets, not disposable analysis output.
!nbody/analysis/presentations/
!nbody/analysis/presentations/**
# Presentation exports — keep source scripts/prompts, ignore generated bundles
nbody/analysis/presentations/**/*.pptx
nbody/analysis/presentations/**/gif/preview/
nbody/analysis/presentations/2026-09-10/dsidm_progress_report_html_v6_fixed.html

# Legacy analysis output; retained files remain readable/tracked, new artifacts do not.
nbody/analyse/**

# Legacy output location is gone; presentation source now lives in analysis/presentations.

# Python caches
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/

#tg bot
telegram.conf
.tgbot_state.json
*.log

# LLM infrastructure
# NOTE (git policy): llm/ is TRACKED on the agent/dev branch so that the bot's
# working process is version-controlled. It must NOT be tracked on master.
# After merging agent/dev into master, untrack it again per the documented
# merge procedure in llm/rules/02-workflow.md.
skills/

# Misc
GEMINI.md
.clineignore
.clinerules/
# Cline project skills are synced copies of tracked skills/ (bash skills/install.sh)
.cline/
